<title>HONG KONG: Cricket-Australia v World XI scoreboard.</title>
<headline>Cricket-Australia v World XI scoreboard.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat a Rest of the World XI by four wickets in a one-day cricket match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Rest of the World XI</p>
<p> S.Manjrekar c Warne b Bichel	   80</p>
<p> L.Klusener b Julian			30</p>
<p> A.Gurusinha c Healy b Julian	    6</p>
<p> A.Malik c Warne b Kasprowicz	   36</p>
<p> R.Gavaskar not out			 51</p>
<p> B.MacMillan b Bichel		     11</p>
<p> S.Pollock c Healy b Julian		3</p>
<p> S.Brew c Healy b Blewett		  7</p>
